**Reader rules**
- `[data-tier="N"]` sets `--tier`, `--tier-hi`, `--tier-lo` and `--tier-wash`. Level 0 sets all four to transparent.
- `[data-metal="gold|silver|bronze"]` sets `--metal`, `--metal-hi`, `--metal-lo` and `--metal-wash`.
- `.crest { color: var(--tier) }`. The crest symbols paint lit cells with `currentColor`.
